WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.725
Collect the x terms on one side, the numbers on the other.

2
00:00:04.502 --> 00:00:08.952
Take three x from both sides. Seven equals two x take nine.

3
00:00:09.605 --> 00:00:12.955
Add nine to both sides, then halve. x is eight.

4
00:00:13.706 --> 00:00:17.306
Check: both sides are thirty one. The lines meet there.
